px;color:var(--text-2);width:56px;flex:none\">Industry</span>\n        <span class=\"cas-box\" style=\"flex:1;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;padding:6px 9px\">Information Technology / Internet<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px\">Submit certification</button></div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"box\"><span class=\"cas-box\">南山区<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"col\"><span class=\"cas-cols\"><span class=\"cas-col\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"opt\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">深圳市<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"next\"><i class=\"cas-next\">▸</i></span></span></span><span class=\"cas-opt\">广州市<i class=\"cas-next\">▸</i></span></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"box\"><span class=\"cas-box\">Nanshan District<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"col\"><span class=\"cas-cols\"><span class=\"cas-col\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"opt\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">Shenzhen<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"next\"><i class=\"cas-next\">▸</i></span></span></span><span class=\"cas-opt\">Guangzhou City<i class=\"cas-next\">▸</i></span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"box","cn":"触发框","en":"Trigger","desc":"回显已选路径，如「广东 / 深圳 / 南山」","desc_en":"Shows the selected path, such as \"Guangdong/Shenzhen/Nanshan\""},{"key":"col","cn":"级联列","en":"Column","desc":"一级一列，选中即展开下一列","desc_en":"One level per column; selecting an item opens the next column"},{"key":"opt","cn":"选项","en":"Option","desc":"当前级的一个可选项","desc_en":"An option for the current level"},{"key":"next","cn":"下级箭头","en":"Arrow","desc":"表示这项还有子级，点它往右展开","desc_en":"Indicates that this item has child levels; click to expand them to the right"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"省市区","en":"Region","demo":"<div class=\"cas-cols\"><div class=\"cas-col\" style=\"min-width:84px\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">广东省<i class=\"cas-next\">▸</i></span></div><div class=\"cas-col\" style=\"min-width:84px\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">深圳市<i class=\"cas-next\">▸</i></span></div><div class=\"cas-col\" style=\"min-width:84px\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">南山区</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"cas-cols\"><div class=\"cas-col\" style=\"min-width:84px\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">Guangdong Province<i class=\"cas-next\">▸</i></span></div><div class=\"cas-col\" style=\"min-width:84px\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">Shenzhen City<i class=\"cas-next\">▸</i></span></div><div class=\"cas-col\" style=\"min-width:84px\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">Nanshan District</span></div></div>","when":"地址等具有明确父子层级的数据","when_en":"Addresses and other data with a clear parent-child hierarchy"},{"cn":"完整路径回显","en":"Path Echo","demo":"<div class=\"cas-box\">广东省 / 深圳市 / 南山区<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"cas-box\">Guangdong Province / Shenzhen City / Nanshan District<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","when":"选了哪几级都要让用户看得明白","when_en":"When users need to see every selected level."},{"cn":"仅末级回显","en":"Leaf Only","demo":"<div class=\"cas-box\">南山区<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"cas-box\">Nanshan District<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></div>","when":"层级仅用于选择过程，提交结果只保留末级节点","when_en":"When the hierarchy only helps with selection and the form should submit just the final-level value."},{"cn":"可搜索","en":"Searchable","demo":"<div class=\"cas-wrap\"><div class=\"cas-box\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">🔍</span>南山</div><div class=\"cas-cols\"><div class=\"cas-col\" style=\"min-width:190px\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">广东省 / 深圳市 / <b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">南山</b>区</span><span class=\"cas-opt\">广西 / 桂林市 / <b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">南山</b>街道</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"cas-wrap\"><div class=\"cas-box\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">🔍</span>Nanshan</div><div class=\"cas-cols\"><div class=\"cas-col\" style=\"min-width:190px\"><span class=\"cas-opt on\">Guangdong Province / Shenzhen City / <b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">Nanshan</b> District</span><span class=\"cas-opt\">Guangxi / Guilin City / <b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">Nanshan</b> Street</span></div></div></div>","when":"选项较多时支持直接搜索路径","when_en":"When there are many options and users need to search for a path directly"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>省市区地址</b>：常见的级联选择场景","m":"sel-cascader"},{"t":"<b>组织架构</b>：公司 → 部门 → 小组","m":"casc-org"},{"t":"<b>商品 / 内容类目</b>：大类 → 小类 → 具体分类","m":"casc-category"},{"t":"<b>选中后回显完整路径</b>：让用户确认自己选了哪","m":"casc-path"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>数据只有一层</b>：使用 {c:select}，无需级联","m":"casc-flat","bad":true},{"t":"需要<b>勾选多个分支</b>：按选择规则评估 {c:tree-select}","m":"ts-dept"},{"t":"每层只有少量选项时，直接平铺会更快","m":"sw-three"},{"t":"<b>选项较多且用户需要搜索</b>：使用可搜索级联","m":"casc-search"}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"收货地址必须从省、市、区中选择一个最终地区，并让用户确认整条路径。哪种方案更合适？","options":[{"id":"single-path-cascader","label":"使用级联选择器逐级选择一条路径，关闭后显示完整路径，提交末级地区 ID","feedback":"对。任务只需要一条父子路径，级联选择能保留选择顺序和最终结果。","correct":true},{"id":"multi-branch-tree","label":"使用多选树，同时勾选多个省市区，并把父级半选状态作为地址结果","feedback":"多选树适合跨分支选择多个范围，不适合只能提交一个最终收货地区的任务。","correct":false},{"id":"three-independent-selects","label":"使用三个互不关联的下拉框，让用户自由组合任意省、市和区","feedback":"三个独立选项无法保证父子关系正确，可能提交并不存在的省市区组合。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A shipping address must choose one final region through state, city, and district and let the user confirm the full path. Which approach fits?","options":[{"id":"single-path-cascader","label":"Use a cascader to choose one path level by level, show the full path afterward, and submit the leaf-region ID","feedback":"Correct. The task needs one parent-child path, and a cascader preserves both the sequence and final result.","correct":true},{"id":"multi-branch-tree","label":"Use a multi-select tree, choose several states and cities, and treat a partial parent as the address result","feedback":"A multi-select tree fits several scopes across branches, not one final shipping region.","correct":false},{"id":"three-independent-selects","label":"Use three unrelated dropdowns and let people combine any state, city, and district","feedback":"Independent choices cannot preserve the hierarchy and may submit a region combination that does not exist.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"把收货地址里的地区字段改成“省 → 市 → 区”级联选择器，每次只选择一条路径，父级不能直接作为最终结果。关闭面板后显示完整路径，提交时保存末级地区 ID；选项较多时支持搜索完整路径。改完后测试首次打开、逐级选择、返回修改上一级、搜索和表单提交，确认显示路径与提交值一致。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Change the shipping-region field to a province → city → district cascader that selects one path at a time, without allowing a parent to become the final result. Show the full path after the panel closes, submit the leaf-region ID, and support full-path search when the option set is large. Test the initial state, level-by-level selection, changing an earlier level, search, and form submission, and confirm the displayed path matches the submitted value."}},"scenes":["收货地址选择","筛选商品类目","分配到部门","选择所属行业"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Region selection","m":"sel-cascader"},{"t":"Product category","m":"casc-org"},{"t":"Organization path","m":"casc-category"},{"t":"Any choice that follows one hierarchy path","m":"casc-path"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use it for data with no real parent-child relationship","m":"casc-flat","bad":true},{"t":"Hide the chosen path after the panel closes","m":"ts-dept"},{"t":"Use several steps when each level has only a few options","m":"sw-three"},{"t":"Make parent selection rules unclear","m":"casc-search"}],"scenes":["Shipping region","Product category","Department path","Content taxonomy"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--te